#
# Counter-example: a math:Coboundary that names no math:coboundaryOf — it does not say
# which math:CoboundaryOperator it is the image under (c = δd), so it is not grounded as
# a coboundary. It fires the derived qualified-min-count frame
# (shacl.QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent → math:IncompleteCoboundary) and NO other
# finding.

@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/coboundary-not-in-image/> .

ex:orphanCoboundary a math:Coboundary .
